# Local/generated artifacts
# Scratch is local by default, but the wayfinder map under
# .scratch/measurable-clip-finder/ is the repo issue tracker and is tracked.
# Note: the pattern must be ".scratch/*", not ".scratch/", or git will not
# descend into the directory and the negation below cannot re-include anything.
.scratch/*
!.scratch/measurable-clip-finder/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pt
transcripts/
packages/remotion/.tmp/
